        <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by an NCP host to send a message to the target application on device. The application on the target must send the response with <ref refid="group__sl__bt__utility__functions_1gafe95b5828a4899cb3eb200d20bd50f2d" kindref="member">sl_bt_send_rsp_user_message_to_target</ref>.</para>
