    <briefdescription>
<para>User Messaging. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides commands and events, which can be used by a NCP host and target to implement a communication mechanism with a custom proprietary protocol. An application must decide whether and how the command and event are used. The Bluetooth host stack does not produce or consume any messages belonging to this class. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
